**[[11:56](https://www.google.com/search?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DjGcxApVFa2c%26t%3D716)]** I'm sorry, I know what he's trying to say with the last one, but it just sounds really dumb: "the worship of flag." I know it's supposed to be, you know, like hyper-nationalism and all that, but yeah, just a very funny way to say it. And while you pretend not to, I'm pretty sure you fucking love money, Dennis! It's actually a pretty common trait among theist talking heads: they will rail against the evils of money, but do give us some! Presumably, they just think they wouldn't possibly be tempted by it, you know, because they are so much better than their followers—which, if true, says terrible things about PragerU fans! Goddamn! Not to mention, I'm sure some of their larger donors probably don't think worshiping money is that bad, if not fucking awesome!

