**[[15:30](https://www.google.com/search?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DjGcxApVFa2c%26t%3D930)]** Dennis... Dennis... I don't know how to tell you this, but that was a fucking movie! I don't know if you don't know this about movies, but movies aren't real life! Also, the whole point of the music in that movie wasn't that he was doing things because he liked the music—he was a sadist! He would have done some of the ultraviolence and his other terrible acts in complete silence if he had to! The plot point of the music was that while he was supposed to be being made averse to terrible acts on display, the choice of music made him have the same reaction to those sounds as he did the terrible acts of cruelty! If you took away from the movie "music makes people bad," your media literacy is through the goddamn planet's core, it's that fucking low! Holy shit!

**[[16:16](https://www.google.com/search?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DjGcxApVFa2c%26t%3D976)]** Take education: we all recognize how important education can be, from preparing people to be able to find work to understanding the world. But education in and of itself, divorced from the higher ends of God and goodness, can lead, and often has led, to great evil.

**[[16:32](https://www.google.com/search?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DjGcxApVFa2c%26t%3D992)]** Oh, do piss off! "Education am only good if you're doing it for God." Tell that to the countless very much secular scientists doing things for the world that will help more people than you could ever dream of! Not to mention those of the wrong faith, taboo. Education is utterly neutral, and the single-minded pursuit of it, pretty much no matter how far, will only really lead to more learning—which, FYI, is not worship! Really, the worst it's going to make someone is quite hard to talk to at parties if they've completely neglected their social skills. Fact is, this is just classic theist anti-intellectual bullshit—probably because smart people make Dennis feel exactly as smart as he absolutely isn't!

